.TH UPTIME 1
.SH NAME
uptime \- time since start
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uptime
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uptime
is a command built into the shell,
.BR sh (1).
It prints the time since the machine started, as
.IB hours : minutes : seconds . milliseconds\fR,
and the number of CPUs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mem (1),
.BR sys_clock (2)
